[?2004l[?2004h>  T=lymph & cd3p
[?2004l[?2004h>  cd4=T & cd4p & ~cd8p; cd8=T & ~cd4p & cd8p; dp=T & cd4p & cd8p; dn=T & ~cd4p & ~cd8p
